    "description": "Usage held in 1 hand. Activate Interact (2 AP).\n\nThe liquid is gathered before dawn from a place where somebody was once healed without payment or obligation.\n\nDrink the vial or administer it to an adjacent willing or helpless creature. Choose one: reduce Soul Drain by 5; reduce Dazed by 1; reduce Weakened by 1; or grant a +4-status bonus to the next saving throw against possession attempted within 1 hour.\n\nThe same creature cannot benefit from another Vial of Sanctified Dew until after a Full Rest.\n\nOn the sheet: drunk or administered (target an adjacent creature to feed it): choose one of the four effects at the Use; the Full Rest limit is a note.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 11.",
